[1;31m│[0m aspect-cli is trying to upload an artifact via GitHub Actions' ArtifactService but the API needs an OIDC token (`ACTIONS_ID_TOKEN_REQUEST_TOKEN`) that GitHub only exposes to the job when `id-token: write` is granted. Without it, the artifact upload fails.
